anese. Please be advised that we cannot accommodate personal interpreters within the competition area.\n\nIn accordance with WCA Regulation [9p2b](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#9p2b), a nationality quota will be applied to the final rounds of this competition. For all final rounds, at least 50% of the finalists shall represent Japan.\n\nOrganized by: Japan Championship 2026 Organizing Committee\nSupported by: Speedcubing Japan\nIn cooperation with: Osaka Cube \/ Kurukuru Kai","externalWebsite":null,"region":"jp"},{"id":"JapanFMCChampionship2026","name":"Japan FMC Championship 2026","city":"Daito, Osaka","country":"JP","date":{"from":"2026-07-04","till":"2026-07-04","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333fm"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Asami Ohkusa","email":"aohkusa@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Ryutaro Miyazaki (\u5bae\u5d0e\u9686\u592a\u90ce)","email":"rmiyazaki@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Yuichi Hamada (\u6ff5\u7530\u7950\u4e00)","email":"yhamada@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Asami Ohkusa","email":"aohkusa@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Ryutaro Miyazaki (\u5bae\u5d0e\u9686\u592a\u90ce)","email":"rmiyazaki@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Takayuki Tanaka (\u7530\u4e2d\u9686\u559c)","email":"cubingmush@gmail.com"},{"name":"Tomoki Moriyama (\u68ee\u5c71\u667a\u6a39)","email":"5120tm@gmail.com"},{"name":"Yasunari Kumekawa (\u7c82\u5ddd\u6cf0\u6210)","email":"yasunari531@gmail.com"},{"name":"Yuichi Hamada (\u6ff5\u7530\u7950\u4e00)","email":"yhamada@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"venue":{"name":"[\u5927\u6771\u5e02\u6c11\u4f1a\u9928](https:\/\/daito-shimin.bambina.jp\/index.html)","address":"4-6, Akebonocho, Daito, Osaka (\u5927\u6771\u5e02\u66d9\u753a4\u756a6\u53f7) \u3012574-0076","details":"4F \u5927\u4f1a\u8b70\u5ba4","coordinates":{"latitude":34.710882,"longitude":135.624858}},"information":"#\u65e5\u672c\u4e00\u3092\u6c7a\u3081\u3088\u3046\u3002\n2026\u5e74\u5ea6\u306e**3x3x3\u6700\u5c11\u